nted bug~~. I've got a few more I want to do PRs for too, but I figure it's best to do them separately rather than all together.\r\n\r\nIn my test scenario, my terrain is setup like so:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"301\" height=\"292\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e27ed225-b47e-48cf-86a2-109233023a28\" />\r\n\r\nif I draw this with the rectangle tool then erase 2 cells...\r\n\r\n<img width=\"213\" height=\"211\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8adba6cf-9c77-46fc-a1bd-3ae3886833e4\" />\r\n\r\nThis is what happens currently\r\n\r\n<img width=\"198\" height=\"201\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/517e0c4b-a630-4b7b-b8d5-1a279b2bc6d1\" />\r\n\r\nThe expected outcome should be something like this. This PR changes the behaviour to this.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"210\" height=\"208\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8ce09c69-d421-4352-85ae-556598e879ed\" />\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https:/